        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wagner Moura, Pablo Escobar, Adriana Esteves\n- Products: Narcos, A Lua Me Disse\n- Organizations: Netflix, Golden Globe Awards\n- Concepts: wealth, criminal notoriety\n\nFacts:\n- A Lua Me Disse starred Adriana Esteves and Wagner Moura in the main roles.\n- From 2015 to 2016, Wagner Moura played the lead role of Pablo Escobar in the Netflix series Narcos.\n- Wagner Moura received a Golden Globe nomination for his role as Pablo Escobar in Narcos.\n- Pablo Escobar was often called \"The King of Cocaine.\"\n- By the early 1990s, Pablo Escobar had an estimated known net worth of US $30 billion, making him the wealthiest criminal in history and one of the richest men in the world in his prime.",
